ato il cadavere. Poi, dopo una settimana, Travis riappare, confuso e allucinato, incapace di ricordare. Quando finalmente recupera le forze, il giovane racconta un'incredibile storia: dice di essere stato rapito da un UFO e sottoposto ad una serie di esami clinici da parte dei suoi occupanti."},{"id":926410,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":58088,"locale":"it","key":"slug","value":"bagliori-nel-buio"}],"keywords":[{"id":74,"name":"based on novel or book","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:48:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:48:55.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":58088,"keyword_id":74}},{"id":159,"name":"small town","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:49:08.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:49:08.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":58088,"keyword_id":159}},{"id":309,"name":"woods","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:50:11.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:50:11.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":58088,"keyword_id":309}},{"id":355,"name":"police","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:50:21.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:50:21.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":58088,"keyword_id":355}},{"id":430,"name":"alien","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:50:38.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:50:38.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":58088,"keyword_id":430}},{"id":625,"name":"biography","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:51:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:51:48.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":58088,"keyword_id":625}},{"id":1265,"name":"arizona","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:55:00.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:55:00.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":58088,"keyword_id":1265}},{"id":3551,"name":"alien abduction","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:09:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:09:26.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":58088,"keyword_id":3551}},{"id":3669,"name":"extraterrestrial","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:10:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:10:51.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":58088,"keyword_id":3669}},{"id":4405,"name":"ufo","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:20:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:20:10.000000Z","p